# Haigen's World — agent rules

## Authority
- Captain approval required before merge or deploy. Never merge/deploy without explicit approval.
- Prefer implementation over planning when an approved brief exists.

## Context (read only what you need)
- **Master plan:** `docs/master-development-plan/README.md` + `PHASE1.md`
- Visual lock: `docs/nordic-visual-bible-230/README.md`, `docs/HAIGENS_WORLD_GAME_BIBLE.md`
- Do not re-audit completed Jobs 228–233 / Heartland #239 unless asked.
- Quiet Nordic HUD = PR #234 (rebase if dirty). Haigen sprite PoC = PR #241.

## Preserve always
Gameplay, AI, collisions/`solidRadius`, landmarks, NPCs, bosses, controls, boats, `wandererV127PreviewSave`, approved atlases until migrated. Prefer draw/packing/atlas swaps; never renumber object IDs.

## Parallelism
- One `haigen.html` writer at a time (or stack PRs). Asset atlases may parallel.
- Huginn=art, Worldbuilder=terrain, Muninn=review/tests.
- Independent review once per head SHA only.

## PR discipline
- One job per PR; bump `haigen-version.json` + `GAME_BUILD` together.
- Evidence: iPhone 390×844 + iPad landscape before/after at fixed cams.
- Reports: PR numbers, changes, evidence, tests, blockers, approval asks — keep short.

